      "Stratagem§Adaptable Avarice": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Persecution Prospect"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of any phase, if units from your army have Fortify Takeover.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEAGUES OF VOTANN CHARACTER** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Each time you use this Stratagem, you can spend any number of YP. Once you have done so, if you have 6 or fewer YP, until the start of your next turn, units from your army have Hostile Acquisition instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§Ancestral Sentence": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Needgaârd Oathband"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEAGUES OF VOTANN** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Each time you use this Stratagem, you can spend 3YP. Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]** ability. If you spent YP during this use of this Stratagem, until the end of the phase, those weapons have the **[SUSTAINED HITS 2]** ability instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§Augmented Assault": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Dêlve Assault Shift"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **CTHONIAN BESERKS** unit from your army that has not been selected to move this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Each time you use this Stratagem, you can spend up to 2YP. Until the end of the turn, add X\" to the Move characteristic of models in your unit, where X is the number of YP you spent during this use of this Stratagem, and your unit is eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced."
      },
      "Stratagem§Auxiliary Contract": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Mercenary Oathband"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEAGUES OF VOTANN INFANTRY** or **LEAGUES OF VOTANN MOUNTED** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[PRECISION]** ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Bastion Running": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Brandfast Oathband"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **HEKATON LAND FORTRESS** unit from your army that has not been selected to move this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time your unit makes a Normal or Advance move, it can move horizontally through terrain features."
      },
      "Stratagem§Brëkkeknots": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Hearthguard Covenant"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly **EINHYR HEARTHGUARD** unit.\n\n**TARGET:** That **EINHYR HEARTHGUARD** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit has 4+ **InSv**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Claimstaker Reflex": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Persecution Prospect"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEAGUES OF VOTANN** unit from your army (excluding **ARTILLERY** and **VEHICLE** units) that is within 8\" of that enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Each time you use this Stratagem, you can spend 2YP. Your unit can make a Normal move of up to D6\". If you spent YP during this use of this Stratagem, your unit can make a Normal move of up to 6\" instead.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** A unit cannot embark within a **TRANSPORT** as part of this move."
      },
      "Stratagem§Cogitated Need": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Hearthfyre Arsenal"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **IRONKIN STEELJACKS** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a Normal move. When doing so, your unit must end that move as close as possible to the closest objective marker."
      },
      "Stratagem§Cyberstimm Infusion": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Dêlve Assault Shift"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **CTHONIAN BESERKS** unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Each time you use this Stratagem, you can spend 2YP. Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, re-roll a Wound roll of 1. If you spent YP during this use of this Stratagem, you can re-roll the Wound roll instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§Delayed-fire Rounds": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Hearthfyre Arsenal"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, just after a **BRÔKHYR**, **IRONKIN STEELJACKS** or **ARKANYST EVALUATOR** unit from your army has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** That **BRÔKHYR**, **IRONKIN STEELJACKS** or **ARKANYST EVALUATOR** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit (excluding **MONSTERS** and **VEHICLES**) hit by one or more of those attacks. Until the start of your next Shooting phase, each time that enemy unit makes a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move, roll one D6 for each model in that unit: for each 1, that unit suffers 1 mortal wound (to a maximum of 6 mortal wounds)."
      },
      "Stratagem§Dispersed Formation": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Persecution Prospect"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEAGUES OF VOTANN INFANTRY** or **LEAGUES OF VOTANN MOUNTED** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, your unit has the Stealth ability and each time a ranged attack targets your unit, models in your unit have the Benefit of Cover against that attack."
      },
      "Stratagem§Exposed Flaws": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Persecution Prospect"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **HERNKYN** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Each time you use this Stratagem, you can spend 2YP. Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, if you spent YP during this use of this Stratagem and/or if that attack targets an assailed unit, you can re-roll the Wound roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§First Concern": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Hearthfyre Arsenal"
          ],
          "Category": [
