          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, just after a **BRÔKHYR**, **IRONKIN STEELJACKS** or **ARKANYST EVALUATOR** unit from your army has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** That **BRÔKHYR**, **IRONKIN STEELJACKS** or **ARKANYST EVALUATOR** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** If your unit Remained Stationary in your Movement phase this turn, it can make a Normal move."
      },
      "Stratagem§Frontier Momentum": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Persecution Prospect"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
