          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **EINHYR HEARTHGUARD** unit is **selected to shoot**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **EINHYR HEARTHGUARD** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s ranged attacks have:\n\n- +1 **S**.\n\n- If you spend 1 **YP**, **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]**."
      },
