          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, just after a **LEAGUES OF VOTANN** unit from your army Falls Back.\n\n**TARGET:** That **LEAGUES OF VOTANN** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back."
      },
      "Stratagem§Hidden Accessways": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
