          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **CTHONIAN BESERKS**, **HEARTHKYN WARRIORS** or **HERNKYN YAEGIRS** unit from your army that is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Remove your unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves."
      },
      "Stratagem§Honour of the Hold": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Needgaârd Oathband"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEAGUES OF VOTANN** unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Each time you use this Stratagem, you can spend 3YP. Select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of your unit. Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a melee attack that targets that enemy unit, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1. If you spent YP during this use of this Stratagem, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 2 instead."
      },
