            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Hearthguard Covenant"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, when a friendly **EINHYR HEARTHGUARD** unit with **Deep Strike** is selected to make an **ingress move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **EINHYR HEARTHGUARD** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** - Your unit can be set up anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 6\" horizontally from all enemy units, even if that is within your opponent’s deployment zone.\n\n- Your unit is __not__ **eligible to declare a charge** until the end of the turn."
      },
      "Stratagem§Mobile Exploitation": {
        "keywords": {
