          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **HERNKYN** unit from your army that is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units. Alternatively, you can spend 2YP and target up to two **HERNKYN** units from your army that are not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units instead.\n\n**EFFECT:** Remove your units from the battlefield and place them into Strategic Reserves."
      },
      "Stratagem§New Horizons": {
        "keywords": {
