          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEAGUES OF VOTANN INFANTRY** unit from your army that is not within Engagement range of one or more enemy units and one friendly **TRANSPORT** it is able to embark within\n\n**EFFECT:** If your **LEAGUES OF VOTANN** unit is wholly within 6\" of that **TRANSPORT**, it can embark within it."
      },
      "Stratagem§Newfound Nemesis": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
