          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has resolved its attacks.\n\n**TARGET:** One Leagues of Votann Infantry or Leagues of Votann Mounted unit from your army that was reduced to Below Half-strength as a result of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** The attacking unit gains 1 Judgement token, or up to 2 Judgement tokens instead if that Leagues of Votann unit contained your Warlord when it was targeted by those attacks."
      },
