          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has shot, if units from your army have Fortify Takeover.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEAGUES OF VOTANN** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can shoot as if it were your Shooting phase, can only target that enemy unit when doing so, and can only do so if that enemy unit is an eligible target."
      },
      "Stratagem§Secure Positions": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Brandfast Oathband"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge",
            "Command",
            "Fight",
            "Movement",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of any of your phases.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEAGUES OF VOTANN TRANSPORT** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** One **LEAGUES OF VOTANN** unit embarked within your **TRANSPORT** can disembark. When doing so, models in that unit can be set up anywhere on the battlefield wholly within 6\" of your **TRANSPORT**. That unit cannot declare a charge in the same turn, but can otherwise act normally in the remainder of the turn."
      },
      "Stratagem§Superior Craftsmanship": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Hearthband"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEAGUES OF VOTANN** unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets a **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** unit, add 1 to the Damage characteristic of that attack."
      },
      "Stratagem§Sure of Purpose": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Hearthband"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEAGUES OF VOTANN** unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a Pile-in or Consolidation move, it can move up to 6\" instead of up to 3\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Tectonic Fracture": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Dêlve Assault Shift"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, just after a **CTHONIAN EARTHSHAKERS** unit from your army has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** That **CTHONIAN EARTHSHAKERS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Each time you use this Stratagem, you can spend 2YP. Select one enemy unit hit by one or more of your unit’s attacks this phase. Until the start of your next Shooting phase, subtract 2 from that unit’s Move characteristic and, if you spent YP during this use of this Stratagem, subtract 2 from Charge rolls made for that unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Unstoppable Force": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Dêlve Assault Shift"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEAGUES OF VOTANN** unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time your unit Piles In or Consolidates, each model in that unit can move up to 6\" instead of up to 3\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Unwavering Accuracy": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Hearthfyre Arsenal"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **BRÔKHYR THUNDERKYN** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, you can ignore any or all modifiers to the following: that attack’s Ballistic Skill characteristic; the Hit roll; the Wound roll; that attack’s Armour Penetration characteristic."
      },
      "Stratagem§Unyielding Aggression": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Hearthband"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, just after a **LEAGUES OF VOTANN INFANTRY** unit from your army Falls Back.\n\n**TARGET:** That **LEAGUES OF VOTANN INFANTRY** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back."
      },
      "Stratagem§Vengeance Flare": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Brandfast Oathband"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEAGUES OF VOTANN INFANTRY** unit that was hit by one or more of those attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Each time you use this Stratagem, you can spend 2YP. Select one friendly **KAPRICUS** or **SAGITAUR** unit within 6\" of your **INFANTRY** unit. If you spent YP during this use of this Stratagem, you can select one friendly **HEKATON LAND FORTRESS** unit within 6\" of your **INFANTRY** unit instead. The selected unit can shoot as if it were your Shooting phase. When doing so, models in the selected unit can only target that enemy unit (and only if it is an eligible target)."
      },
      "Stratagem§Void Armour": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Oathband"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One Leagues of Votann unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the\nattacking unit has finished making its attacks, each time an attack targets your unit, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Void Hardened": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Needgaârd Oathband"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets, if units from your army have Fortify Takeover.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEAGUES OF VOTANN** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, each time an attack targets your unit, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Wall of Steel": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Hearthfyre Arsenal"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Charge phase, just after an **IRONKIN STEELJACKS** unit from your army ends a Charge move.\n\n**TARGET:** That **IRONKIN STEELJACKS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Each time you use this Stratagem, you can spend 2YP. Select one enemy unit (excluding **MONSTERS** and **VEHICLES**) within Engagement Range of your unit and roll one D6 for each model in your unit, rolling two additional D6 if you spent YP during this use of this Stratagem: for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound (to a maximum of 6 mortal wounds)."
      },
      "Stratagem§Warrior Pride": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Oathband"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s",
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One Leagues of Votann unit from your army, and one enemy unit that has one or more Judgement tokens and is within Engagement Range of that Leagues of Votann unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a melee attack that targets that enemy unit, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1 for each Judgement token that enemy unit has."
      },
      "Stratagem§Weavewurke Buttress": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Leagues of Votann",
            "Dêlve Assault Shift"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets, if units from your army have Hostile Acquisition.\n\n**TARGET:** One **LEAGUES OF VOTANN INFANTRY** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, subtract 1 from the Wound roll."
      },
