        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **HERNKYN** unit is **selected to shoot**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **HERNKYN** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s ranged attacks have **[LETHAL HITS]**.",
