      "Stratagem§Economy of Motion": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move within 8\" of a friendly **unengaged** **PIONEERS** unit.\n\n**TARGET:** That **PIONEERS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a **normal move** of up to D3+3\".",
