        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** Up to two friendly **SAGITAUR** units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit. Your units’ ranged attacks that target that enemy unit can:\n\n- Re-roll **hit rolls** of 1.\n\n- Re-roll **wound rolls** of 1.",
