        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Movement phase, from the second battle round onwards.\n\n**TARGET:** Up to two friendly **SAGITAUR** units in **strategic reserves**.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your units each make an **ingress move**.",
